{
  "id": "JDG.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Judges 1",
  "verseCount": 36,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass after the death of Joshua, that the children of Israel asked of Jehovah, saying, Who shall go up for us first against the Canaanites, to fight against them? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jehovah said, Judah shall go up: behold, I have delivered the land into his hand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Judah said unto Simeon his brother, Come up with me into my lot, that we may fight against the Canaanites; and I likewise will go with thee into thy lot. So Simeon went with him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Judah went up; and Jehovah delivered the Canaanites and the Perizzites into their hand: and they smote of them in Bezek ten thousand men. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they found Adoni-bezek in Bezek; and they fought against him, and they smote the Canaanites and the Perizzites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Adoni-bezek fled; and they pursued after him, and caught him, and cut off his thumbs and his great toes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Adoni-bezek said, Threescore and ten kings, having their thumbs and their great toes cut off, gathered ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " under my table: as I have done, so God hath requited me. And they brought him to Jerusalem, and he died there.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the children of Judah fought against Jerusalem, and took it, and smote it with the edge of the sword, and set the city on fire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And afterward the children of Judah went down to fight against the Canaanites that dwelt in the hill-country, and in the South, and in the lowland. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Judah went against the Canaanites that dwelt in Hebron (now the name of Hebron beforetime was Kiriath-arba); and they smote Sheshai, and Ahiman, and Talmai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And from thence he went against the inhabitants of Debir. (Now the name of Debir beforetime was Kiriath-sepher.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Caleb said, He that smiteth Kiriath-sepher, and taketh it, to him will I give Achsah my daughter to wife. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Othniel the son of Kenaz, Caleb’s younger brother, took it: and he gave him Achsah his daughter to wife. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass, when she came ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", that she moved him to ask of her father a field: and she alighted from off her ass; and Caleb said unto her, What wouldest thou? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And she said unto him, Give me a blessing; for that thou hast set me in the land of the South, give me also springs of water. And Caleb gave her the upper springs and the nether springs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the children of the Kenite, Moses’ brother-in-law, went up out of the city of palm-trees with the children of Judah into the wilderness of Judah, which is in the south of Arad; and they went and dwelt with the people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Judah went with Simeon his brother, and they smote the Canaanites that inhabited Zephath, and utterly destroyed it. And the name of the city was called Hormah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also Judah took Gaza with the border thereof, and Ashkelon with the border thereof, and Ekron with the border thereof. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jehovah was with Judah; and drove out ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the hill-country; for he could not drive out the inhabitants of the valley, because they had chariots of iron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they gave Hebron unto Caleb, as Moses had spoken: and he drove out thence the three sons of Anak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the children of Benjamin did not drive out the Jebusites that inhabited Jerusalem; but the Jebusites dwell with the children of Benjamin in Jerusalem unto this day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the house of Joseph, they also went up against Beth-el; and Jehovah was with them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the house of Joseph sent to spy out Beth-el. (Now the name of the city beforetime was Luz.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the watchers saw a man come forth out of the city, and they said unto him, Show us, we pray thee, the entrance into the city, and we will deal kindly with thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he showed them the entrance into the city; and they smote the city with the edge of the sword; but they let the man go and all his family. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the man went into the land of the Hittites, and built a city, and called the name thereof Luz, which is the name thereof unto this day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Manasseh did not drive out ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Beth-shean and its towns, nor ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Taanach and its towns, nor the inhabitants of Dor and its towns, nor the inhabitants of Ibleam and its towns, nor the inhabitants of Megiddo and its towns; but the Canaanites would dwell in that land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass, when Israel was waxed strong, that they put the Canaanites to taskwork, and did not utterly drive them out.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
